{"id":"715d126877a6c443","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-right-linear.md","title":"右线性","display":"df-right-linear — 右线性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-right-linear","aliases":["56-df-right-linear"],"display":"df-right-linear — 右线性","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"§2.3 Definition 2.3.3(i)","source_printed_pages":"39","source_ocr_blocks":[60],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-right-linear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-right-linear</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-right-linear — 右线性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.3 Definition 2.3.3(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"39"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pos}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pos}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t|_p\">\\(t|_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\left|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(r):r|_p=x\\}\\right|\\leq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RightLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\left|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(r):r|_p=x\\}\\right|\\leq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右线性不依赖左线性；去除了原来倒向临界对的无关依赖。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pos}$ 与 $t|_p$ 见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pos}$ 与 $t|_p$ 见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pos}","display":false},{"tex":"t|_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RightLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\left|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(r):r|_p=x\\}\\right|\\leq1.","display":true}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"c15a7b71d4b695